---
title: "is_fresh_update (Pyth Sui Contracts)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_get_update_ts: update_timestamp = price::get_timestamp(update_price)
    q_get_update_ts --> q_get_cached_ts: cached_timestamp = price::get_timestamp(cached_price)
    q_get_cached_ts --> q_compare: update_timestamp > cached_timestamp
    q_compare --> [*]: return (update_timestamp > cached_timestamp)

    note right of q_compare
        INV-001: freshness is strictly greater-than (not greater-or-equal)
        INV-002: prevents replay of same-timestamp updates
    end note
